  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to the boil for the spaghetti. Coarsely chop the capers and hazelnuts. Pick half the parsley leaves, then finely chop the remaining leaves, discarding the stems.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4195074/photos/large/81283_1-c235be18180c2bfb050ff150e0792ffe.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook spaghetti: Cook three-quarters of the spaghetti in the pan of boiling water for 12 mins or until al dente. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4195079/photos/large/81283_2-be8b23673ee775970e999479f37d7c3e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Start sauce: Meanwhile, put the tomatoes, capers, chopped parsley, half the Italian seasoning, 2 tbs olive oil and 1 tsp balsamic vinegar in a large deep bowl (see Make it yours). Season with salt and pepper and stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4195082/photos/large/81283_3-66ab3808878cddc808939b7c5d06e59b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Crush tomatoes: Coarsely crush the tomatoes with a potato masher (if the tomatoes splatter too much, prick them a few times with a fork or the tip of a knife before crushing). Add the spaghetti to the tomato mixture and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4195086/photos/large/81283_4-1feb2c8cbd5735c59bfc55c434a60610.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the spaghetti among bowls. Scatter over the hazelnuts and remaining parsley. Crumble over the feta and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4195090/photos/large/81283_5-6eefee3d4a74e6b0bdfcb30552462a26.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: If you like, add a little sugar to the sauce to help balance the acidity of the vinegar and tomatoes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4195093/photos/large/81283_6-408b4460b8095c3d46723e0380d2b4ed.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
